sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 客户端
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant V as DRF 视图
    participant S as PlayerService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>LS: 读取 anon_id
    alt 不存在
        C->>C: 生成 UUID v4
        C->>LS: 写入 bjtu-rogue:anon_id
    end
    C->>V: 携带 anon_id 的任意请求(反馈/遥测)
    V->>S: get_or_create(anon_id)
    S->>DB: get_or_create(Player, anon_id)
    DB-->>S: Player
    S->>DB: touch(last_seen_at, client_version)
    S-->>V: Player
    V-->>C: 正常响应
